=head1 DESCRIPTION

The risk evaluation by adaptive authentication, as displayed in an
C<AdminListUserAuthEvents> response. Contains evaluations of
compromised-credentials detection and assessed risk level and action
taken by adaptive authentication.

=head1 ATTRIBUTES


=head2 CompromisedCredentialsDetected => Bool

Indicates whether compromised credentials were detected during an
authentication event.


=head2 RiskDecision => Str

The action taken by adaptive authentication. If C<NoRisk>, your user
pool took no action. If C<AccountTakeover>, your user pool applied the
adaptive authentication automated response that you configured. If
C<Block>, your user pool prevented the attempt.


=head2 RiskLevel => Str

The risk level that adaptive authentication assessed for the
authentication event.



